{"v":4,"catch":"虛構攜帶式掌機 GAME BUDDY 遊戲系列第六部！\n使用10名角色來進行對戰吧！","desc":"格鬥遊戲的復古風格以現代風格回歸！\n\nPixel Game Maker 系列《DANDAN Z》是一款激烈的 1 對 1 格鬥遊戲。\n\n10名獨特的角色擁有各種特殊必殺招式。\n找到您喜歡的角色來開始對戰吧!\n在戰鬥過程中，您可以連打 B 鍵來輕鬆施展 \"DANDAN 連擊\"，\n透過連擊來積累能量值，並使用兩種超級特殊必殺技來擊敗對手！\n\n本遊戲支持雙人對戰！\n還等什麼?快來對戰吧！\n\n此遊戲是由Maker系列中專門製作動作遊戲的軟體「Pixel Game Maker MV」所製作。此遊戲系列均能在Nintendo Switch™上遊玩。","publisher":"Gotcha Gotcha Games","release":"2023-12-07","genres":["街機","動作","格鬥"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54802a7103283c5bdd8588aeadb8a56542fe3a2d1603c18f93ed24a90bf5a463.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7407f6da2104d39615e8963e3e809e7a85520609cd70da6140e3b0d858b9a7a8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/19e35317e473e4bd8fdf17a75d22f06f915fb68a6fe6ff2189223ecad3273529.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5d0341fee1f44cfeccdcc80bf7b7524b82c9d93a9ba300d848b91e6596cc2907.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c69dd25f57629c9c25e79d8786bbf6fdfd9ab0ec33ad9d4ce0990e7cef1d09f7.jpg"],"titleId":"010099f017b3c000","dlc":[]}